</script><div style="margin-top:.5rem;font-size:.78rem;color:#888;text-align:center"><a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=37.6393419&mlon=-120.9968892#map=11/37.6393419/-120.9968892" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Location and service area</a></div></div></section><footer style="background:#18181B;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);padding:3rem 1.5rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center"><p style="margin:1.5rem 0 0;font-size:.82rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)">Modesto, USA · <a href="mailto:contact@geotechnicalengineering1.biz" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)">contact@geotechnicalengineering1.biz</a> · © 2026</p></div><div data-updated="2026-04-05" style="font-size:.78rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);margin-top:.8rem">Last updated: 2026-04-05</div><div data-authority-refs class="authority-refs" style="text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;padding:.5rem 0;opacity:.6"><strong>References:</strong><a href="https://www.astm.org/products-services/standards-and-publications.html" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">ASTM Standards</a> · <a href="https://www.publications.usace.army.mil/USACE-Publications/Engineer-Manuals/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">USACE Engineer Manuals</a> · <a href="https://www.iso.org/committee/49802.html" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">ISO Geotechnical</a></div></footer><script>(function(){
